description = "Needs a sleeping or held nightmare. The next hit on one waking, or let go from a Hold, from any Warden, deals double damage."
tip = "Within 2 s of waking or being let go. Sleep comes from Nod Off, Dreamshroom and The Great Bell; Holds from the Rootling line. One doubled hit per bell a second. A bet: it does nothing until something of yours stops nightmares."
